"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
3056,"**
Narrated to us Abdullah ibn al-Hakam ibn Abi Ziyad al-Qataniy (RA) — the ascetic of Kufah — narrated to us Zayd ibn al-Hubab, who narrated to us Sufyan al-Thawri. And narrated to us Ahmad ibn Yahya al-Sadafi, who narrated to us Zayd, who narrated to me Sufyan al-Thawri, on the authority of Ja'far ibn Muhammad, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Jabir ibn 'Abdullah (RA), that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) performed three Hajjs: two Hajjs before the migration, and one Hajj after the migration, with which he combined an 'Umrah.

Ahmad ibn Yahya (RA) added: *and he combined Hajj with 'Umrah* (i.e., he performed Hajj with Qiran)."
